Z||000000||whamel||10-08-2000||11:20 PM||||     Just wanted to drop you guys a line and thank you for all the info and conversations I've had here!  I got a killer deal on a Porsche and while looking around at all my cars I realized I have way too many right now and the Porsche is way too interesting to me.  I'm selling all my Fieros (they seem to be spoken for already) and all my stuff and moving back into Porsche's.  I'll probably be back in the spring to pick up a good solid Fiero that I'm going to keep, but for now I'll be taking some time off.  I'll see you guys in the spring...<BR>     If any of you guys are ever in my area and need anything just let me know.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Thanks for everything,<BR>Wade<BR>||||reg||9
Z||000001||Tigger||10-08-2000||11:37 PM||||I hate to see a forum and fellow Fiero guy go.<P>Porsche eh'  you'll be crawling back to the Fiero forum the first time you try to read those german service manuals.  Glut teack hammen tag.  Bolten de karberator to dak manifolden intak.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Just kidding..  What model or year is it?  Got a pic?  Anyway, good luck with it, hopefully we'll see you back here soon!<P>------------------<BR>T-T-F-N, Tah Tah For Now!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tigger.gif">          <BR> <A HREF="mailto:RacingStripes@hotmail.com">RacingStripes@hotmail.com</A> ||||reg||12
